<title>USA: D&amp;N Financial to repurchase 400,000 shares.</title>
<headline>D&amp;N Financial to repurchase 400,000 shares.</headline>
<dateline>TROY, Mich. 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>D&amp;N Financial Corp said Monday its board  approved the repurchase of 400,000 of the company's 7.7 million outstanding common shares.</p>
<p>The company said it views the stock buyback as an opportunity to increase earnings per share and the return on stockholder equity. Funding for the program will come from the exercising of outstanding warrants, said the company.</p>
<p>The repurchase will be dependent on market conditions and availability, said the company.</p>
<p>D&amp;N Financial is a bank holding company.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
